# Third-party albums stay local: large, watermarked, and someone else's client documents.
# Identity is preserved by the sha256 recorded in data/layout_cases/*.json.
00_Master/*.pdf

# _Survey/ holds the photo survey of three comparable flats - Realt.by and
# Kvadratny Metr listing photos, i.e. third-party watermarked material. Same
# treatment as the album PDFs in 00_Master: the BYTES stay out of git, and
# identity is kept in git via sha256 in _Survey/manifest.csv.
_Survey/**/*.jpg
_Survey/**/*.jpeg
_Survey/**/*.png
